WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:02.868
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.939
And now,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.207
According to a new book,
President Biden

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.410
proposed to
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.979
five times before she
agreed to marry him.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:16.082
So basically, he proposed
marriage the same way

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.316
that he ran for President.

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:18.984
"How about now?

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:21.521
Okay, how about now?"

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.689
A growing number
of top Russian officials

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:25.291
are reportedly
starting to question

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.760
President Vladimir Putin's
invasion of Ukraine.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.429
Which means there's about to be
a shrinking number

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:32.065
of Russian officials.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.699
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.699 --> 00:00:36.803
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
criticized Disney yesterday

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:39.972
for opposing Florida's
so-called "Don't Say Gay" bill,

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.674
and questioned
what kind of content

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.442
the company will now produce,
adding,

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:45.278
"In every episode now,

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:48.681
they're gonna have
Mickey and Pluto going at it."

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.117
What are you talking about?

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.852
In every episode?

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.222
You have to build up
to something like that.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:00.125
That's season finale stuff.

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:01.928
The FBI recently arrested a man

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.829
for participating in
the Capitol attack

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:07.366
after he was turned in by
the driver of the Uber he took

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:08.668
after the insurrection.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.037
Well, that'll teach him him
to give 3-star rating.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:12.472
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.809
"Politico" this week published
its first election forecast

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.610
for the 2022 midterm cycle.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:21.014
Not to be outdone,
Fox New already called it.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:22.415
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:25.718
The fast food chain Popeye's
announced plans yesterday

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.554
to launch a flagship
in Times Square.

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.822
Man, I miss the gritty days
of this city,

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:31.790
when the only place to eat
in Times Square

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.593
was the Olive Garden.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.662
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:38.130
And unnamed worker has filed
a labor complaint

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.967
that alleges Nintendo violated
their right to unionize.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.369
Well, it wouldn't be
the first time they tried

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:46.706
to sow discord by pitting
tradesmen against each other.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.273
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.273 --> 00:01:50.777
According to a new study,
the legalization of marijuana

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.245
lowers the demand for
prescription medication.

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:55.948
I mean, sure, why go
all the way to Duane Reade

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:57.717
when you can just go
to Dwayne?

00:01:57.717 --> 00:02:00.586
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:03.355
And finally -- thank you to
my drug dealer, Dwayne,

00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:04.490
for letting me use this picture,
by the way.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:05.825
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.093
I mean, I guess that's
one of the nice things

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.928
about, you know, the
decriminalization of it all.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.097
Two years ago, he'd be like,
"No, man."

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.932
And now he's like, "No, yeah."

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:18.371
"I don't know, you can
put my number up, too."

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:19.906
And finally,
in a new interview,

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.174
the co-founder of
Arizona Beverages said that

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:26.212
the brand's popular iced tea
will remain priced at 99 cents,

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.281
despite inflation,
which sounds amazing

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:31.017
until you see how much they've
shrunk their iced cans.

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.218
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.254
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

